      "message": "So far as I can tell, `getSessionID` and `waitSession` are only called by `clientHandshake` and `serverHandshake` immediately after creating the transport.\n\nYou should be able to drop the `connTransport` type, change `connection.transport` to a `packetConn`, and and make the handshake functions operate on the concrete `*handshakeTransport`:\n\n```\ntransport :\u003d newClientTransport(...)\nif err :\u003d transport.waitSession(); err !\u003d nil {\n  return err\n}\n\nc.transport \u003d transport\nc.sessionID \u003d transport.getSessionID()\n```",
