      "side": 1,
      "message": "This makes a copy of the whole buffer on each call.\n\nRather than hand-rolling types to do (de)serialization here, how about using x/crypto/cryptobyte? (https://pkg.go.dev/golang.org/x/crypto/cryptobyte) cryptobyte.Builder replaces controlBuffer, cryptobyte.String replaces controlMessage.",
